        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Company and the Union will establish a training committee that will develop a training program for New Hires, Transferees. The training committee will also look at the training needs for the incumbent employees and identify the types of work in Distribution that can safely be performed by one person.",
            "block_bbox": [
